# World -1 room 4 (Boing), for `NATHAN_MINUS_ONE=4 scripts/record-run --capture`.
# A physics glitch instead of a tile swap: pause mid-toot off the ground and pick B0NC3!. The
# ground keeps its look and collision but turns into a trampoline: Nat can't stop bouncing.
# Low bounces under the ceiling brushes (one pause in the air to time the sewage), then hold
# jump for a high bounce onto the goal's ledge.
wait 1.5
tap Enter
wait 0.6
hold Space 140ms
wait 120ms
hold Space 100ms
wait 90ms
tap Esc
wait 0.8
repeat 6
  tap Down
  wait 0.3
end
wait 0.5
tap Enter
wait 0.1
hold Right 0.9
wait 0.5
hold Right 1.6
hold Right Space 1.0
wait 4
